OL,3,ATransport workers in Chile block
OL,4,Ahighways in protest over surging fuel
OL,5,Aprices
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of transport workers in Chile
OL,8,Fhave blocked roads and highways across
OL,9,Fthe country in protest over high fuel
OL,10,Fprices.
OL,12,FDrivers of busses and lorries began
OL,13,Fprotesting on Tuesday, gathering in
OL,14,Fconvoys to halt traffic along major
OL,15,Froutes.
OL,17,FThey are demanding a relief from
OL,18,Fsurging diesel prices, which have been
OL,19,Fdriven up by the war in Iran.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
