OL,3,ATransport workers in Chile block
OL,4,Ahighways in protest over surging fuel
OL,5,Aprices
OL,6,
OL,7,FTalks between government officials and
OL,8,Fprotest leaders have so far failed to
OL,9,Freach a resolution, with another
OL,10,Fmeeting expected to take place on
OL,11,FWednesday.
